GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_StackOverview> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_StackOverview> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#StackOverview> ;
    narr:childCount "5"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "c38a50d94165f93e52a1939c7dd60902504dacd0" ;
    narr:narration """As of 11 July 2026, the analytics database stack is mid-pivot: [Quinton Fairweather's formal announcement](narr:Obs_MeridianAdoptionStatement) replaced Zypherion with Meridian, a decision [also captured as an adoption statement](narr:Obs_AdoptionStatement) on the same date. The [supersession narrative](narr:Narrative_ZypherionAdoption) frames this explicitly as overturning a prior Zypherion adoption, with the trigger being critical gaps in Zypherion's streaming ingestion. [Meridian's native batch-and-streaming capability](narr:Position_StreamingIngestionCapability) is recorded as the decisive technical factor, and [Meridian's status as the chosen database](narr:Position_ZypherionDatabaseChoice) formalises the rejection of Zypherion. Migration is targeted for Q3 2026 — the decision is committed but execution remains ahead. This hub covers: analytics database selection rationale, the Zypherion-to-Meridian transition, streaming ingestion as a capability criterion, and the named decision authority. It does not cover implementation detail, cost analysis, or vendor evaluation beyond ingestion capability.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_ZypherionAdoption> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Obs_AdoptionStatement> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Obs_MeridianAdoptionStatement> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_StreamingIngestionCapability> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ZypherionDatabaseChoice> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "critical gaps in streaming ingestion" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_ZypherionAdoption> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Meridian handles both batch and streaming natively" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_ZypherionAdoption> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Migration remains Q3 2026" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_ZypherionAdoption> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "This supersedes the prior Zypherion adoption decision" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_ZypherionAdoption> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "This capability was the decisive factor over Zypherion" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_StreamingIngestionCapability> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "A prior Zypherion adoption decision existed and was reversed — the stack was not always Meridian-bound; the superseded choice is structurally present but its original rationale is not recorded here." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_ZypherionAdoption> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ZypherionDatabaseChoice> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The decision is committed but the migration is not yet complete (Q3 2026 target) — the stack is in a declared-but-unexecuted transition state, not a settled one." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_ZypherionAdoption> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The rejection rationale is narrowly scoped to streaming ingestion gaps; no child records whether other Zypherion capabilities were evaluated or found adequate, leaving the full comparative picture open." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_StreamingIngestionCapability> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ZypherionDatabaseChoice> ] ;
    narr:writer "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6" .
